<title>UK: IBCA rates DSL unit notes due 2004 AAA.</title>
<headline>IBCA rates DSL unit notes due 2004 AAA.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>IBCA, the European rating agency said on Tuesday it had assigned a long-term rating of AAA to DSL Finance NV's 500 million mark 5.25 percent notes due 2004.</p>
<p>The issue is guaranteed by Deutsche Siedlungs- und Landesrentenbank (DSL Bank).</p>
<p>&quot;The rating is based on the implied federal German guarantee for the obligations of DSL Bank,&quot; IBCA said in a statement.</p>
<p>--International Bonds Unit +44 171 542 4041</p>
</text>
